  "limits": "Relies on the Bevel shader node, which only Cycles evaluates; EEVEE returns the plain normal, so no wear appears there. Detects convex and concave edges alike within the radius. Noise-based chips, not a wear simulation. Rendered here with Cycles CPU only. Verified in Blender 5.2.1; written for the 4.2 API.",
